<title>GERMANY: Norway buys 9,000 tonnes EU August wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Norway buys 9,000 tonnes EU August wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway has bought three shiploads of 3,000 tonnes each of European Union milling wheat for August shipment, German traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The wheat for non-EU Norway would be British or Danish, with the origin and port decision up to the exporter who made the deal and guided by price, they said.</p>
<p>The traders gave no price indication.</p>
<p>French traders said on Wednesday Norway was seeking 6,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
